    'M5.5 3.5h3l1.5 4-2 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 7 7l1.5-2 4 1.5v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A17 17 0 0 1 3.5 5.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z',
